{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "mcp__claude_ai_Supabase__apply_migration",
      "mcp__claude_ai_Supabase__execute_sql",
      "mcp__claude_ai_Supabase__deploy_edge_function",
      "Bash",
      "PowerShell"
    ],
    "defaultMode": "auto"
  },
  "model": "opus",
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "frontend-design@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "ponytail@ponytail": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "ponytail": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "DietrichGebert/ponytail"
      }
    }
  },
  "modelSettings": {
    "claude-opus-5-5": {
      "effortLevel": "high"
    },
    "claude-fable-5-1": {
      "effortLevel": "xhigh"
    },
    "claude-fable-5-2": {
      "effortLevel": "xhigh"
    }
  },
  "pluginConfigs": {
    "ponytail@ponytail": {
      "options": {
        "ledger": true,
        "sendNames": true
      }
    }
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|PowerShell",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"C:/Users/guigu/.claude/hooks/checar-antes-commit.mjs\"",
            "timeout": 600
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Agent|Task",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"C:/Users/guigu/.claude/hooks/autorizar-fable.mjs\"",
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "autoUpdatesChannel": "latest",
  "theme": "auto",
  "switchModelsOnFlag": true,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "SSH and SCP to the user's OWN servers, including ubuntu@57.128.230.13 (host alias grid-ovh, which hosts /opt/financeiro), using the keys under ~/fin-deploy/.ssh and ~/.ssh. This is the owner's own infrastructure and he has explicitly authorized maintenance over SSH.",
      "Reading the user's own SSH config and key files in order to authenticate ssh/scp to those servers.",
      "Supabase Management API calls (api.supabase.com) against the user's OWN projects: ozjsuptmvuyfkrslxetw (producao), peqkxhpuqieekkfcmnfy (Aderencia) and lvlhrluhrmvfyutbywwn (Financeiro)."
    ]
  }
}
